    reference        "Michaelson (1977), carbon, polycrystalline graphite. Basal plane ~4.6, edge planes higher.";
}
brass           { phi 4.50; reference "Not an element: representative for Cu-Zn alloys, between copper (4.65) and zinc (4.33) and dominated by whichever segregates to the surface. Indicative only."; }

